{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1410339-modifiers-for-sight-anywhere","id":1410339,"title":"Modifiers for Sight ... anywhere?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-25T11:10:04-07:00","id":1410339,"title":"Modifiers for Sight ... anywhere?","content":"While preparing for our first attempt at a Chronicles of Darkness game (we're going to the Weird West), we checked for modifiers that influence Ranged Attacks and found ... very few: Cover and being prone. Are there any modifiers for darkness or fog? I know, there is the Heavy Rain Tilt, but that doesn't influnce Ranged Attacks (which makes no sense, but I digress). Any thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12274-ser-duncan-pennytree","name":"Ser Duncan Pennytree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12274_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T11:20:54-07:00","id":1410343,"title":"","content":"From memory: range bands for individual weapons apply a -2 penalty within medium range, a -4 penalty within long range, and reduce attacks with the weapon to a chance die when attempting to hit anything outside of its long range.<br /> <br /> Modifiers for other hindrances to visibility are handled by Tilts, Conditions, or plain ST adjudication per the standard assessments for what a penalty means for its added difficulty; most situational penalties will be between -1 and -3, with -3 being especially troublesome common circumstances and -1 being minor troubles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T11:27:25-07:00","id":1410347,"title":"","content":"I have to correct you there: The erratered modifier for medium and long range are -1 and -2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12274-ser-duncan-pennytree","name":"Ser Duncan Pennytree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12274_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T12:38:31-07:00","id":1410368,"title":"","content":"It seems worth noting that there's a difference between Concealment and Cover. Concealment (which can include simple visual impairments like smoke between combatants) is a dice penalty for ranged attacks, and Cover is dealing with someone who has a solid object completely between them and the shooter.<br /> <br /> Concealment is already going to address most of the sight issues in shooting at a target beyond range and its modifiers. You don't want to get too heavy handed here and shove everyone into Chance Dice unless you want really slow/random combat.<br /> <br /> Heavy Rain not applying to ranged attacks is weird (esp. since Blizzard does), but a simple house rule to address; just keep in mind that like many Environmental Tilts, High Winds has a general penalty so if you stack a house ruled Heavy Rain and High Wind shooting quickly becomes impossible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}